@HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5072

### Health check (200 "Healthy")
GET {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/health

### Ticket termico 80mm (alto automatico) con hoja de estilos por URL
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "html": "<h3 style='text-align:center'>TICKET #1</h3><p>Item A ..... $10.00</p><hr/><b>Total $15.00</b>",
  "paperSize": "Thermal80",
  "styleSheetUrls": ["https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/normalize.css@8.0.1/normalize.css"]
}

### Ticket termico 58mm
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "<p>Ticket angosto</p>", "paperSize": "Thermal58" }

### Hoja A4 horizontal con margen de 15 mm
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "<h1>Hola</h1>", "paperSize": "A4", "landscape": true, "marginMm": 15 }

### Tamano personalizado (100 x 150 mm)
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "<h2>Etiqueta</h2>", "paperSize": "Custom", "widthMm": 100, "heightMm": 150 }

### Error 400 invalid-request: Custom sin widthMm
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "x", "paperSize": "Custom" }

### Error 400 validation-error: widthMm fuera de rango
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "x", "paperSize": "Custom", "widthMm": 5, "heightMm": 100 }

### Error 400 malformed-body: paperSize desconocido
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "x", "paperSize": "Foo" }

### Error 400 invalid-request: hoja de estilos con esquema no permitido
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: application/json

{ "html": "x", "styleSheetUrls": ["ftp://example.com/estilo.css"] }

### Error 415: tipo de contenido no soportado
POST {{HtmlToPdfApi_HostAddress}}/api/pdf
Content-Type: text/plain

x
